---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: "{% if pagination.pageNumber == 0 %}/work.html{% else %}/work/page/{{ pagination.pageNumber + 1 }}/index.html{% endif %}"
title: 生活记录｜赵荣力
description: 赵荣力的生活记录，分享旅行、日常与和家人朋友相处的时光。
activeNav: work
hasLightbox: true
hasMath: true
pagination:
  data: collections.life
  size: 10
  reverse: true
  generatePageOnEmptyData: true
---
<div class="main-content">
  <header>
    <h1 class="extra-title">这大概就是我的生活吧</h1>
    <p class="stream-intro"><em>think more</em></p>
  </header>
  {% include "partials/life-pager.njk" %}
  {% set orderedEntries = pagination.items | reverse %}
  {% if not orderedEntries.length %}
  <p class="life-empty">这里暂时没有新的生活记录，可通过分页查看较早的记录。</p>
  {% endif %}
  {% for entry in orderedEntries %}
    {% if orderedEntries | lifeYearStart(loop.index0) %}<span id="life-year-{{ entry.date | lifeYear }}" class="life-year-anchor"></span>{% endif %}
    {% include "partials/life-entry.njk" %}
  {% endfor %}
  {% include "partials/life-pager.njk" %}
</div>
